# Runtime state — lives under ./data and ./icons locally (and is bind-mounted
# at /app/data / /app/icons for container runs), so
# baking the host copies into the image only bloats it (and the build-context
# upload on the CX22) with a stale snapshot of the live SQLite DB + icons.
data
icons
